        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nearl!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their sniper... is ridiculous!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Nearl gets hit again, she won't be able to defend herself anymore!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nearl, you need to retreat!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't... He's too powerful. I can't afford to let him hit our squads.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to intercept his attacks!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "She managed to block Faust's ballista... with only a shield--?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unbelievable... Impossible!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do it again!! Blow her to pieces!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "--!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... it's coming from my right? !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh no! Hurry, dodge--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "As if I'd let you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
